/*
 * SultanC canonical lexical token registry.
 *
 * This file is the single canonical owner of lexical token identity across
 * Bootstrap and the self-hosted compiler: semantic constructor identity,
 * lexical class, lifecycle, keyword/operator spellings, and payload category.
 * Generated mirrors are consumers and must not own independent token policy.
 *
 * Token lifecycle:
 *   Active          — consumed by current grammar.
 *   Future_Reserved — deliberately lexed but parser-dormant and qualification-frozen.
 */

